    '尚未接触。': 'No contact yet.', '预设中，短时间接触也可以发生转移。五秒不是安全开关；发生转移也不等于某个人一定生病。': 'In this preset, transfer can happen during brief contact. Five seconds is not a safety switch, and transfer does not mean a person will definitely become ill.', '明显油污情境下，肥皂加流水更适合；还要留意遗漏区域。': 'With visible grease, soap and running water are more appropriate; missed areas still matter.', '明显油污会影响清洁：免洗洗手液不能替代此时的肥皂加流水，清水也不善于带走油污。': 'Visible grease changes the situation: hand sanitiser does not replace soap and running water here, and water alone is poor at removing grease.', '手没有明显脏污、又不方便用肥皂和水时，合规格免洗洗手液可用；仍需覆盖所有手部并搓至干燥。': 'When hands are not visibly dirty and soap and water are unavailable, a suitable alcohol-based hand sanitiser can be used; cover all hand surfaces and rub until dry.', '肥皂与流水帮助带走污物和微生物；外观干净仍不等于没有不可见因素。': 'Soap and running water help remove dirt and microbes; looking clean does not mean invisible factors are absent.', '清水与肥皂加流水不等同；覆盖不到的区域更容易被忽略。': 'Water alone is not equivalent to soap and running water; uncovered areas are easier to miss.',
    '正对界面进入时，方向没有转弯。换介质仍可改变光速；不转向不等于什么都没变。': 'At normal incidence the path does not bend. Changing medium can still change propagation speed; “no bend” does not mean nothing changed.', '两边都是同一空气预设，方向没有改变。换成水或玻璃，再比较。': 'Both sides use the same air preset, so direction is unchanged. Try water or glass and compare.', '斜着进入较高折射率的介质，路径靠近法线。转向取决于入射角和两边介质，不是“遇水就一定转弯”。': 'Entering a higher-index medium at an angle bends the path towards the normal. Direction depends on angle and both media, not simply “light always bends in water”.', '两侧的质量可以不同；质量 × 到支点的距离相同，理想横杆也能平衡。支点同时提供向上的支持力。': 'The masses can differ. If mass × distance from the pivot is equal on both sides, the ideal beam can balance; the pivot also supplies an upward support force.', '在小振幅、张力不变的理想弦模型中，拨得更大主要改变振幅，不自动提高基频。缩短有效弦长或增加张力，才会提高这个模型的基频。': 'In the small-amplitude ideal-string model at fixed tension, a harder pluck mainly changes amplitude rather than automatically raising the fundamental frequency. Shortening the effective length or increasing tension raises the model frequency.',
